# Minimal data model tips (objects/fields)

* `Risk_Alert__c`: `Patient__c` (Lookup), `Score__c` (Number), `Reason__c` (Long Text), `Status__c` (Picklist: Open/In Progress/Closed), `Source__c` (Picklist: AI/Manual).
* `Adherence_Log__c`: `Patient__c`, `DateTime__c`, `Type__c` (Taken/Missed), `Notes__c`.
* `Care_Program__c` ↔ `Trial_Protocol__c` (Lookup or junction if you need many-to-many).
* `ServiceAppointment` fields you already use for visits.

